><surname>Naldoni</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Petrella</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Ponti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Segnan</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Sigona</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Zarcone</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Zorzi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Zappa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Paci</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>11</day><month>11</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>04</day><month>11</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>99</volume><issue>10</issue><fpage>1756</fpage><lpage>1756</lpage><copyright-statement>Copyright 2008, Cancer Research UK</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2008</copyright-year><permissions><copyright-holder>Cancer Research UK</copyright-holder></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Correction to:</bold> <italic>British Journal of Cancer</italic> (2008) <bold>99</bold>, 423&#x02013;427, doi:<related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x3f12cf0N0x326e4b0" ext-link-type="doi" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="10.1038/sj.bjc.6604532">10.1038/sj.bjc.6604532</related-article></p><p>Owing to an error during typesetting, there was a mistake introduced in Duffy's formula in this paper when first published in <italic>British Journal of Cancer</italic> in July 2008.</p><p>The formula was contained within the &#x02018;Materials and Methods' section and should have appeared, thus:<disp-formula id="equ1"><!-- in formula template--><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="6604779e1.jpg"/></disp-formula></p><p>The publishers are happy to correct this mistake.</p></body></article>